Lazy computation | Transformations build a logical plan and actions request execution. Inspect explain before collecting large results into driver memory. | Transformation; Action; Plan | from pyspark.sql import SparkSession\ns=SparkSession.builder.master('local[2]').appName('lab').getOrCreate()\nprint(s.range(6).filter('id>=3').count()) | 3 | Teams review distributed plans before expensive jobs. | Compare explain output before and after grouping.
